      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T02:25:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for the lack of clarity.\nMy issue is that it introduces a new state which has a different transition behavior from `Running` compared to the existing `NotRunning`. This is not a change that I think is safe to keep.",
      "parentUuid": "be615592_e978f887",
